> Where do you want to jump?  (For instructions type a ?)
> A tower of flame erupts from the floor!  Your wooden shield smoulders!
> Your scrolls of light catch fire and burn!
> Your potion of sickness boils and explodes!
> A tower of flame erupts from the floor!  Your gloves smoulder further!
> Your potion of extra healing boils and explodes!
> 
