> 
I assume it's triggered twice because first you are in the air above the 
fire trap and then you land on the trap itself. I would say it is not 
/necessarily/ a bug, because it is not entirely unreasonable for this to 
  happen. Consider another situation where you are levitating. You go 
over the trap, and you would expect to be fried. Then you descend and 
land on the trap. In this case, I would certainly expect it to go off again.

 From a gameplay point of view, I don't think it should go off twice on 
the same move, but the rest of it makes sense.


